From 9d50906a7096136efb9a9c7abfc49b7c93dcef14 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: anyingiit <49945850+anyingiit@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 23:37:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] config: check referenced local files with --config.check

Make --config.check also verify that the local files referenced by the
configuration exist and are readable, so that a configuration that
points to a missing body_file, TLS CA/certificate/key file or credential
file fails the check instead of only failing later at probe time.

The check covers http body_file, the HTTP client config of the http and
websocket probers (basic_auth username/password files, authorization
credentials_file, oauth2 client secret/key files and TLS files, and
http_headers files), websocket header files, and the tls_config of the
tcp, unix, dns and grpc probers. No network requests are made.

Fixes #1687
